    <string name="help_tools_body">The equalizer and the sleep timer are in the player and in Settings. From a track’s menu you can edit its tags and cover, cut a part into a new file (Music/Orotund), set it as ringtone, or delete the file from the phone – deleting always asks first and is separate from removing it from a playlist.</string>
