    <string name="help_player_title">Player</string>
    <string name="help_player_body">Tap the song at the bottom to open the full player. Swipe the bottom player left or right to change songs. The Previous button first returns to the start of the song; within the first seconds (Settings) it goes to the previous song. The repeat button offers four modes, including stopping at the end of the current song.</string>
    <string name="help_stats_title">Play counts and lyrics</string>
    <string name="help_stats_body">A play counts when you have listened to half of the song (at most 4 minutes). You can change the count in the song menu. The Lists tab shows Most played and Recently played automatically. Lyrics stored in the file appear on the Lyrics page of the player, where you can also add or edit them.</string>
